    "$comment": "One motion for everything that appears, leaves or reacts (popovers, hover states, scrims): durations in ms, easings as cubic-bezier control points. Web: hk-pop / --motion-* / ease-out; Swift: Motion.*. `loop` is the period of the one loading shimmer (AI at work).",
